pplication/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":283,"digest":"sha256:8f590ed383e60d3bf1ed45bcc6717d475ed42bcf76a15ea79a4684afa48c4a2b","download_count":5,"created_at":"2026-09-20T18:29:47Z","updated_at":"2026-09-20T18:29:47Z"},{"id":577331311,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSIatD84iaWBv","name":"Reasonix-windows-arm64-installer.exe","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":143800992,"digest":"sha256:9ac280155a3df44f180be08909b5e3e675c1ae890430aaa1530999890ed66919","download_count":18,"created_at":"2026-09-20T18:30:03Z","updated_at":"2026-09-20T18:30:07Z"},{"id":577331835,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSIatD84iaWJ7","name":"Reasonix-windows-arm64-installer.exe.minisig","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":293,"digest":"sha256:1f6cefb0408f866b67c5d562249be030d64556fb13c5e087fea38f3b503ed578","download_count":5,"created_at":"2026-09-20T18:30:20Z","updated_at":"2026-09-20T18:30:20Z"},{"id":577330160,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSIatD84iaVvw","name":"Reasonix-windows-arm64.zip","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":215879204,"digest":"sha256:4ed97f9748d055d6a3b3ac1b5f28637649ea7027c918c31b498eaf7c235dd2c9","download_count":10,"created_at":"2026-09-20T18:29:21Z","updated_at":"2026-09-20T18:29:28Z"},{"id":577332329,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSIatD84iaWRp","name":"Reasonix-windows-arm64.zip.minisig","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":283,"digest":"sha256:c21dbb58836ca306171a6bf073802dcc86a2d4379aaa0349f13c583e5e5a9ceb","download_count":5,"created_at":"2026-09-20T18:30:41Z","updated_at":"2026-09-20T18:30:41Z"}],"body":"> 此版本提升了会话迁移、接管与导出的可靠性，修复了 Windows 凭据与 Shell 问题，并完善图片附件在提交、历史记录与导出中的处理。\n\n**发布渠道：稳定版 · v1.38.11**\n\n[English →](https://reasonix.io/changelog/v1.38.11/?lang=en) · [网页版完整更新日志 →](https://reasonix.io/changelog/v1.38.11/)\n\n## 使用攻略\n\n- [**历史会话按需迁移**](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/blob/ec82bb3251550b03b43b83418a716f73fe758ffd/docs/HISTORICAL_SESSION_MIGRATION_ON_DEMAND.md) — 了解历史会话如何按需迁移以及如何管理它们。\n- [**远程会话**](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/blob/ec82bb3251550b03b43b83418a716f73fe758ffd/docs/REMOTE_SESSIONS.md) — 了解跨端会话接管与远程会话管理。\n- [**会话草稿生命周期**](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/blob/ec82bb3251550b03b43b83418a716f73fe758ffd/docs/SESSION_DRAFT_LIFECYCLE.md) — 关于持久化本地草稿及其生命周期的详细信息。\n- [**会话导出**](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/blob/ec82bb3251550b03b43b83418a716f73fe758ffd/docs/SESSION_EXPORT.md) — 固定快照会话导出的工作原理。\n- [**Windows 沙箱**](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/blob/ec82bb3251550b03b43b83418a716f73fe758ffd/docs/WINDOWS_SANDBOX.md) — Windows 沙箱退役与工具层边界。\n- [**附件修复**](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/blob/ec82bb3251550b03b43b83418a716f73fe758ffd/docs/ATTACHMENT_REPAIR_10457.md) — 图片附件的接纳、持久化与导出。\n\n## 概览\n\n**Reasonix v1.38.11 — 桌面版 1.38.11：会话可靠性、Windows 修复与图片附件**\n\n此版本提升了会话迁移、接管与导出的可靠性，修复了 Windows 凭据与 Shell 问题，并完善图片附件在提交、历史记录与导出中的处理。\n\n发布日期：2026-09-20\n\n**Desktop 28 · CLI 1**\n\n## 桌面端更新\n\n### 重点内容\n\n- **[Desktop]** **历史会话按需迁移** — 启动时不再重放历史导入。会话显示在侧边栏中，打开时进行迁移，身份与所有权可靠。 ([#10566](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10566))\n- **[Desktop · CLI]** **跨端会话接管** — 在桌面端与 CLI 之间通过交接、回收与镜像接管会话。桌面端回收后 CLI 保持存活。 ([#10320](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10320))\n- **[Desktop]** **Windows 凭据自锁问题已解决** — 凭据保存不再依赖 ACL 修复。已移除退役的沙箱后端，凭据文件受到保护，避免自锁。 ([#10562](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10562), [#10561](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10561), [#10559](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10559), [#10466](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10466))\n- **[Desktop]** **会话中的图片附件** — 图片在会话边界被接纳，持久化在草稿中，显示在历史记录中，并包含在导出中。 ([#10545](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10545), [#10546](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10546), [#10547](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10547), [#10548](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10548))\n- **[Desktop]** **会话导出捕获完整历史** — 导出现在使用固定的权威快照，因此长对话包含所有消息和工具结果。 ([#10471](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10471))\n- **[Desktop]** **授权确认不再卡死** — 初始授权与停止操作可靠工作，具有正确的取消与结果传播。 ([#10552](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10552))\n\n### 新增\n\n- **[Desktop]** **持久化本地草稿** — 草稿按工作区保存，无需创建会话，并清理历史空会话。 ([#10469](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10469))\n- **[Desktop]** **模型级思考能力** — 思考设置按模型解析，修复旧连接与会话思考强度的绑定。 ([#10500](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10500))\n\n### 改进\n\n- **[Desktop]** **会话标题一致性** — AI 重命名现在更新所有界面，未命名会话显示其首条用户消息。 ([#10558](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10558))\n- **[Desktop]** **新会话草稿页** — 健康草稿显示欢迎输入框，正式会话仅在首条消息后创建。 ([#10551](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10551))\n- **[Desktop]** **草稿模型与标题对齐** — 新会话草稿遵循实时默认模型，避免内部路由标题。 ([#10572](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10572))\n- **[Desktop]** **会话状态归属** — 交互卡片绑定到其原始请求，防止跨会话泄漏。 ([#10507](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10507))\n- **[Desktop]** **Windows 工作区归属** — 修复重复工作区所有者，导航在关闭期间可取消。 ([#10554](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10554), [#10570](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10570))\n- **[Desktop]** **文件系统身份统一** — 路径身份与锁跨版本统一，修复 Windows 大小写问题。 ([#10518](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10518))\n- **[Desktop]** **Windows Shell 执行** — Shell 命令使用 PowerShell，工作目录与进程处理更加可靠。 ([#10553](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10553))\n- **[Desktop]** **会话导出身份** — 导出固定到捕获的会话身份，防止冲突。 ([#10580](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10580))\n- **[Desktop]** **归档会话保持归档** — 单头历史会话归档后不再重新出现。 ([#10490](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10490))\n- **[Desktop]** **保存会话恢复** — 启动时协调保存的标签页，不丢失有效会话或未知字段。 ([#10510](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10510))\n- **[Desktop]** **快照记录身份** — 每条记录获得稳定身份，修复水合失败。 ([#10550](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10550))\n- **[Desktop]** **退出与诊断** — 退出等待会话持久化，崩溃诊断得到改进。 ([#10520](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10520))\n- **[Desktop]** **AI 会话标题预算** — 模型调用拥有完整超时，避免过早失败。 ([#10575](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10575))\n- **[Desktop]** **归档后空白会话** — 归档最后一个会话不再创建空白替代。 ([#10560](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10560))\n- **[Desktop]** **Transcript 初始化崩溃** — 格式错误的旧基线不再导致启动崩溃；会话保持可修复。 ([#10501](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10501))\n\n### 修复\n\n- **[Desktop]** **Session-id 路由隔离** — 规范会话路由与旧文件路径分离，防止元数据损坏。 ([#10549](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10549))\n- **[Desktop]** **Windows 凭据 ACL 测试** — 测试隔离防止凭据修复中的误报。 ([#10514](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10514), [#10517](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10517))\n- **[Desktop]** **ACP 销毁等待** — 销毁测试具有确定性，避免计时波动。 ([#10519](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10519))\n\n## CLI 端更新\n\n### 重点内容\n\n- **[Desktop · CLI]** **跨端会话接管** — 在桌面端与 CLI 之间通过交接、回收与镜像接管会话。桌面端回收后 CLI 保持存活。 ([#10320](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10320))\n\n## 其他项目更新\n\n- **[Site]** **官网跟随当前正式版** — 下载面板现在解析最新正式版，而非过时的固定版本。 ([#10487](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10487))\n\n## 升级提醒\n\n- **[Desktop]** **Windows 沙箱已退役** — 操作系统级沙箱不再强制执行。Shell 命令以当前用户身份运行，工具层边界仍然有效。 ([#10559](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10559), [#10561](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10561))\n- **[Desktop]** **历史会话在首次打开时迁移** — 启动更快；历史会话显示在侧边栏中，打开时进行迁移。 ([#10566](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10566))\n\n## 风险提示\n\n当前没有需要额外操作的已知风险。\n\n## 致谢\n\n感谢本版本的贡献者：[@SivanCola](https://github.com/SivanCola)、[@XTLine](https://github.com/XTLine)\n\n## 下载与安装\n\n- [官网按平台下载](https://reasonix.io/?download=desktop&channel=stable#start)\n- [查看完整差异](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/compare/desktop-v1.38.10...desktop-v1.38.11)\n","reactions":{"total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0}}
